## 1. How a Request Flows

Every authenticated API request goes through **this exact chain**:

```
Client Request
     │
     ▼
[Global Prefix]     →  /api/v1/...
     │
     ▼
[JwtAuthGuard]      →  Is there a valid JWT?  (GLOBAL — runs on every route)
     │                  └── @Public() routes skip this
     ▼
[CaslGuard]         →  Does user have permission?  (PER-CONTROLLER)
     │                  └── @CheckAbility({ action, subject }) defines what's needed
     │                  └── Builds ability, stores in req.ability
     ▼
[ValidationPipe]    →  Is the DTO valid?  (GLOBAL)
     │                  └── whitelist + forbidNonWhitelisted
     ▼
[Controller]        →  Route handler runs
     │
     ▼
[Service]           →  Business logic + Prisma queries
     │
     ▼
[ResponseInterceptor] → Wraps in { success: true, data: ... }
     │
     ▼
Response sent ✅
```

**If anything throws:**
```
Any Exception
     │
     ▼
[GlobalExceptionFilter]  →  Catches everything
     │                      →  Maps Prisma errors to user-friendly messages
     │                      →  Returns { success: false, error: { code, message } }
     ▼
Error Response ❌
```

