## Quick Reference Card

| I want to... | Do this |
|---|---|
| **Protect a route** | `@CheckAbility({ action: 'read', subject: 'Enquiry' })` |
| **Skip JWT on a route** | `@Public()` |
| **Get current user in controller** | `@Req() req: Request` → `req.user.userId` |
| **Get CASL ability in controller** | `@Ability() ability: AppAbility` or `req.ability` |
| **Filter by permission in service** | `where: accessibleBy(ability).Enquiry` |
| **Manual permission check** | `ability.can('update', 'Enquiry')` |
| **Log something** | `this.logger.log('msg')` — NOT console.log |
| **Throw 404** | `throw new NotFoundException('msg')` |
| **Throw 400** | `throw new BadRequestException('msg')` |
| **Throw 403** | `throw new ForbiddenException('msg')` |
| **Add a nav item** | Add to `NAV_ITEMS` in [lib/navigation.tsx](file:///d:/code/final/frontend/lib/navigation.tsx) |
| **Check permission (server page)** | [can(user.permissions, 'read', 'Enquiry')](file:///d:/code/final/frontend/lib/permissions.ts#81-96) |
| **Check permission (client component)** | `useAuthStore().can('read', 'Enquiry')` |
| **Call an API from frontend** | Create a service in `services/` using [apiClient()](file:///d:/code/final/frontend/lib/api-client.ts#121-256) |
| **Handle button mutation** | Use [useAction(serverAction)](file:///d:/code/final/frontend/hooks/use-action.ts#6-68) hook |
| **Handle form submission** | Use `useActionState(serverAction)` |

---

> **Remember:** The system is permission-based, not role-based. Never write `if (role === 'ADMIN')`. Always write `if (can('action', 'Subject'))`.
